      "structural_stress": "Unchanged at 4.8. New fiscal strain signal: planned Sovcomflot minority-stake sale and forecast 3.2%-GDP 2026 deficit. Real property-rights deterioration: temporary takeover of JTI operations. Counterevidence: actual October oil-and-gas receipts increased roughly 9% y/y to ₽971bn (partly quarterly tax timing), Bank of Russia reports +1% Q3 GDP, and partial diesel export recovery. High stress, but no justified net 0.1 movement.",
